{
  "id": "expired-certification",
  "title": "Certificate expired, then renewed",
  "ruleId": "CERT-001",
  "domain": "people",
  "note": "Move 15 days past Ama Serwaa Owusu's First Aid expiry, attach the renewal, and the alert auto-resolves. The same jump also surfaces the standing gaps (Nana's missing certificate, the penetration-test deadline, Meridian's missing SOC 2, Cedar's lapsed DPA, the dependency scan warning) — all six opens are part of the expected set.",
  "steps": [
